OL,3,GNEWSAMan hopes hobby will 'make him
OL,4,Alive a little longer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA craftsman has said building owl boxes
OL,7,Fhas "given him purpose" after his
OL,8,Fcancer diagnosis.
OL,10,FRob Stephenson said he first started
OL,11,Fcrafting owl nest boxes in Keswick when
OL,12,Fhe was 12-years-old, but after a recent
OL,13,Fincurable pancreatic cancer diagnosis
OL,14,Fhe was unable to work.
OL,16,FThe 63-year-old said: "What can I do to
OL,17,Fmake me live a little longer?", adding
OL,18,Fhe loved "working with his hands and
OL,19,Fbrain" so he began building custom-made
OL,20,Fboxes for tawny, barn, and little owls
OL,21,Fin Cumbria.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
