OL,3,GNEWSAMan hopes hobby will 'make him
OL,4,Alive a little longer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the project has made him "light
OL,7,Fup", and "when you go through tough
OL,8,Ftimes in life, you've got to get the
OL,9,Fgood out of bad".
